.TH imify-policies-download 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify\-policies\-download \- Download a checkpoint of a policy into a directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify policies download\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPOLICY\fR> <\fICHECKPOINT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download a checkpoint of a policy into a directory.
.PP
Downloads the checkpoint directory with pretrained_model/ and training_state/, loadable with LeRobot\*(Aqs \-\-policy.path. CHECKPOINT is an id from `imify policies show`, or `latest` for the checkpoint with the highest step. Works in every policy state. Downloads 4 files at a time. Running the same download again continues an interrupted one; the download refuses to start when the directory holds files that are not part of the checkpoint.
.PP
Known limitation: while a policy is training, its newest checkpoint may still be uploading. Storage lists only finished files, so such a download can succeed with files missing.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Target directory [default: ./<POLICY>\-<CHECKPOINT>]
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: profile, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Settings profile in the config file [env: IMIFY_PROFILE] [default: default]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIPOLICY\fR>
The policy id
.TP
<\fICHECKPOINT\fR>
The checkpoint id, or `latest` for the checkpoint with the highest step
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  imify policies download run\-3c9e1a7f latest
  imify policies download run\-3c9e1a7f 020000 \-o ./pick\-cube\-act
